---
title: "transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_verify_sig: verify authorization signature from investor
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_source: investedCapital[source] > 0
    q_check_source --> q_check_dest: investedCapital[destination] == 0
    q_check_dest --> q_transfer_state: copy all position data from source to destination
    q_transfer_state --> q_clear_source: clear source position
    q_clear_source --> [*]: emit PositionTransferredWithAuth event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid authorization signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_source --> q_revert_no_pos: no source position
    q_revert_no_pos --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_dest --> q_revert_exists: destination has existing position
    q_revert_exists --> [*]: revert PositionAlreadyExists

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: authorization signature must come from the investor (source address)
        INV-002: signature prevents unauthorized position transfers
        INV-003: combines operator authority with investor consent
    end note
